MID_SE_Led_Orh_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_001: ♪
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_002: Leda...your playing is beautiful. Sorry, I shouldn't\ndisturb you. I'll come back later.
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_003: If you need me for something, now's fine. I can play\nthe vihuela anytime.
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_004: Actually... I'm here because I feel I owe you\na real apology.
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_005: During the Heroic Games, I couldn't do what you\nwanted. I'm sorry for that.
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_006: Oh...
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_007: Since that time, I've been through a lot. I understand\nnow why you made the request you did.
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_008: So that's what this is about? You shouldn't have\nworried. It hasn't been on my mind.
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_009: For you, it might feel like something that happened\nrecently. But for me, that was a long time ago.
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_010: Still...while I can sympathize with your feelings,\nI can't condone your desire for revenge!
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_011: Please, Leda. Let's find something you can do that\nwill bring peace to your heart instead!
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_012: Something that'll bring peace to my heart?\nLike what?
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_013: Well...like baking. Or doing laundry. If you focus on\nthese sorts of things, your heart is sure to be soothed.
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_014: You'll also feel a sense of accomplishment and have\ngreater self-confidence!
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_015: THAT'S how my heart finds peace? Look, Orchel,\nI've already tried doing those kinds of things.
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_016: I mean, sure, I'm not very good at cooking and would\nrather leave that to someone else...
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_017: But if doing a bunch of mundane tasks could truly\nbring me peace...life would be a lot easier.
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_018: That makes sense. I thought my idea would solve\neverything, but in hindsight...maybe not.
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_019: Well, I'll think of something to soothe your heart!
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_020: A quiet activity for the Rose of Caelus... Ooh!\nMaybe you'd enjoy tending a garden?
MID_SE_Led_Orh_B_021: Sure. That will fix everything.
